","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bcf49727e0c1c533b19.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24895-1-14-2","ko":"응. 고민 끝에 어제 남자 친구에게 이별을 선언해 버렸지.","zh":"嗯。经过一番纠结，我昨天就向男朋友提出了分手。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"고민","meaning":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","explanation":"고민：苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","readings":[{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19225","senseId":"1","lemma":"고민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}},{"text":"끝에","meaning":"完，到头，最后","explanation":"끝：完，到头，最后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"끝","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48072","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝에","audio":"/audio/0e6f0e4b320e727897bc.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","explanation":"남자：男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"친구에게","meaning":