unciation":["어제"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"56f2a16263b76a11","term":"이별","zh":"离别，告别","audio":"/audio/56f2a16263b76a111bea.mp3","entryId":"24895","definition":"分别或分开，长时间无法相见。","pronunciation":["이ː별"]},{"id":"c94d4ac6e179ddea","term":"선언하다","zh":"宣布，宣告","audio":"/audio/c94d4ac6e179ddeabcf7.mp3","entryId":"44902","definition":"明确说出自己的想法或立场。","pronunciation":["서넌하다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4470c87f5ce5bd23a34e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.909,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24895","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6343,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你和男朋友分手了吗？","嗯。经过一番纠结，我昨天就向男朋友提出了分手。","没找到风扇吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你和男朋友分手了吗？","嗯。经过一番纠结，我昨天就向男朋友提出了分手。","没找到风扇吗？"],"answer":1}]}
